  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Asia-Pacific Regional Platform for Disaster Risk Reduction</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This investment supported co-hosting with the UN Office for Disaster Risk Reduction (UNDRR) 2022 Asia Pacific Ministerial Conference on Disaster Risk Reduction (APMCDRR). The conference assisted Indo-Pacific developing countries address challenges to implementing the Sendai Framework for Disaster Risk Reduction. Convened technical discussions and workshops among participants from governments, NGOs, civil society, on practices in reducing and managing disaster risk. Ministerial components of the meeting provided officials with political support to continue implementing. This investment aligns with Australia&#x2019;s Foreign Policy White Paper commitments and efforts to build the resilience of Indo-Pacific countries. It was an opportunity to promote disaster resilience and sustainable development. Australia&#x2019;s contribution will cover the ODA-eligible components associated with convening the conference.</narrative>
  </description>
